---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Bayu Distira">
  <div class="relative w-full">
    
    {/* SECTION 1: Base / Hero */}
    <section class="sticky top-[70px] md:top-[90px] z-10 bg-brand-bg flex flex-col items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left min-h-[60vh] pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-36 md:pb-48 md:px-12">
      {/* 1. PROFESSIONAL IDENTITY */}
      <div class="mb-12 w-full">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">Bayu Distira Azis</h1>
        <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-sans text-brand-text/60 mb-6">ByU</h2>
        
        <p class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-6">
          Informatics Student &middot; Builder &middot; Writer
        </p>
        
        <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/70 text-lg max-w-2xl mb-8 leading-relaxed mx-auto md:mx-0">
          Based in Indonesia. Interested in technology, software, science, literature, sports, people and the universe.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center md:justify-start gap-4">
          <a href="#" class="px-6 py-3 bg-brand-text text-brand-bg font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:bg-brand-accent transition-colors">
            Download CV &darr;
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/ByU-7" target="_blank" class="px-6 py-3 border border-brand-text/20 text-brand-text font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:border-brand-text transition-colors">
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="px-6 py-3 border border-brand-text/20 text-brand-text font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:border-brand-text transition-colors">
            LinkedIn
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:firqiansyahbayu@gmail.com" class="px-6 py-3 border border-brand-text/20 text-brand-text font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:border-brand-text transition-colors">
            Email
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* QUOTE */}
      <div class="mt-4 text-center w-full">
        <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif italic text-brand-text/80 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          "I like understanding things by taking things apart..."
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* SECTION 2: A Little About Me */}
    <section class="sticky top-[80px] md:top-[100px] z-20 bg-[#eae5d7] border border-brand-text/10 rounded-t-3xl shadow-[0_-10px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] px-6 md:px-12 pt-12 pb-36 md:pb-48 flex flex-col">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center md:text-left w-full">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-8 text-center">A Little About Me</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 font-serif text-brand-text/80 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I am an Informatics student whose curiosity often spills beyond the edges of a computer screen. While my formal education teaches me how to write efficient algorithms and structure databases, my true passion lies in understanding how things work. whether it's a piece of software, human nature, or the cosmos.
          </p>
          <p>
            I build things because I want to see if I can. I write because it is the only way I can untangle the thoughts in my head. And I explore because the world is too vast to only be seen from one perspective.
          </p>
          <p>
            I believe that the best software is built by people who read books, watch films, and take walks. Technology is just a tool; the stories we tell and the problems we solve with it are what actually matter.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* SECTION 3: What I Do */}
    <section class="sticky top-[90px] md:top-[110px] z-30 bg-[#e4dfd1] border border-brand-text/10 rounded-t-3xl shadow-[0_-10px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] px-6 md:px-12 pt-12 pb-36 md:pb-48 flex flex-col">
      <div class="w-full">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-12 text-center">What I Do</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
          <a href="/work" class="group block p-8 border border-brand-text/10 hover:border-brand-text/30 transition-all bg-brand-bg/60 hover:bg-brand-bg rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-brand-text mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">BUILD</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/60 text-sm mb-6">Websites, applications, and experiments.</p>
            <span class="text-xs font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">See Projects &rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/writing" class="group block p-8 border border-brand-text/10 hover:border-brand-text/30 transition-all bg-brand-bg/60 hover:bg-brand-bg rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-brand-text mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">WRITE</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/60 text-sm mb-6">Essays and reflections about things I find worth thinking about.</p>
            <span class="text-xs font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Read Essays &rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/wander" class="group block p-8 border border-brand-text/10 hover:border-brand-text/30 transition-all bg-brand-bg/60 hover:bg-brand-bg rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-brand-text mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">EXPLORE</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/60 text-sm mb-6">Ideas, places, activities, and experiences outside my routine.</p>
            <span class="text-xs font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">View Log &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* SECTION 4: Things I Like */}
    <section class="sticky top-[100px] md:top-[120px] z-40 bg-[#ded9cb] border border-brand-text/10 rounded-t-3xl shadow-[0_-10px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] px-6 md:px-12 pt-12 pb-36 md:pb-48 flex flex-col">
      <div class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-10 text-center">Things I Like</h2>
        
        {/* Row 1: Films & Music side-by-side */}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10">
          {/* Films */}
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/70 text-lg">Films</h3>
              <a href="https://letterboxd.com/ByU_7/" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-sans tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-text/40 hover:text-[#00e054] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
                Letterboxd <span class="text-sm leading-none">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2.5">
              {[
                { title: '12 Angry Men', img: 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYjE4NzdmOTYtYjc5Yi00YzBiLWEzNDEtNTgxZGQ2MWVkN2NiXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg' },
                { title: 'Hacksaw Ridge', img: 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjQ1NjM3MTUxNV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTgwMDc5MTY5OTE@._V1_.jpg' },
                { title: 'Sheep Detective', img: 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNTFmZWI4YmMtNmQ0ZC00ZGQwLTk1OWEtZjAyZmIzOGY0MGFiXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg' },
                { title: 'Grave of the Fireflies', img: 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNTY5MmE2OGMtN2IxNC00MDY4LTkwMGEtZDUzOTYyNWE0ZTNjXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg' }
              ].map(film => (
                <div class="aspect-[2/3] bg-brand-text/5 border border-brand-text/10 flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-sm hover:ring-2 hover:ring-[#00e054]/60 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden group">
                  <img src={film.img} alt={film.title} class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[20%] group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Music */}
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/70 text-lg">Music</h3>
              <a href="https://open.spotify.com/user/314npirsxushfghesqmm5g3ceoki?si=44234286a7424ce5" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-sans tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-text/40 hover:text-[#1DB954] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
                Spotify <span class="text-sm leading-none">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2.5">
              {[
                { name: 'Reality Club', type: 'Artist', img: 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music126/v4/58/7f/69/587f69ed-0c73-4138-0b3a-7e595799b80b/23UMGIM09976.rgb.jpg/600x600bb.jpg' },
                { name: 'For Revenge', type: 'Artist', img: 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music128/v4/8c/9b/0e/8c9b0e99-748c-8c30-5f24-7f6cce483a39/38ce80c2-ea8d-44ed-b5b8-c5a20bbd57b7.jpg/600x600bb.jpg' },
                { name: 'Taylor Swift', type: 'Artist', img: 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music221/v4/be/e1/48/bee148d6-d16c-d8f7-0173-d6cf6d684aa1/08PNDIM00678.rgb.jpg/600x600bb.jpg' },
                { name: 'Linkin Park', type: 'Artist', img: 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music115/v4/13/44/05/134405bd-9e27-a678-8953-b5f724201f95/093624948988.jpg/600x600bb.jpg' }
              ].map(artist => (
                <div class="bg-brand-text/[0.03] p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-text/[0.06] transition-colors cursor-pointer group text-center">
                  <div class="w-full aspect-square bg-brand-text/10 rounded-full mb-2 shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center group-hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden">
                     <img src={artist.img} alt={artist.name} class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
                  </div>
                  <h4 class="font-sans font-bold text-brand-text text-[11px] truncate leading-tight">{artist.name}</h4>
                  <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/50 text-[9px] mt-0.5">{artist.type}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Row 2: Books, Sport, Thoughts */}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6 border-t border-brand-text/10">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/70 text-lg mb-2">Books</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">Norwegian Wood &middot; Cosmos &middot; Pale Blue Dot</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/70 text-lg mb-2">Sport</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">Badminton &middot; Futsal &middot; Swimming</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/70 text-lg mb-2">Hours Thinking About</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              The universe &middot; Human nature<br/>
              Why people do what they do<br/>
              How things work
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* SECTION 5: Currently & Milestones */}
    <section class="sticky top-[110px] md:top-[130px] z-50 bg-[#d4cfc0] border border-brand-text/10 rounded-t-3xl shadow-[0_-10px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] px-6 md:px-12 pt-12 pb-24 flex flex-col mb-16">
      {/* 5. CURRENTLY */}
      <div class="mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-10 text-center">Currently</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-y-8 gap-x-12">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 text-sm mb-1">Learning</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-base">Astro &amp; Modern Web Development</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 text-sm mb-1">Building</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-base">This digital garden</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 text-sm mb-1">Reading</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-base">Cosmos</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 text-sm mb-1">Listening</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-base">Reality Club</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-2 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 text-sm mb-1">Wondering About</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-lg leading-relaxed">
              If we are a way for the universe to know itself, what does it think of us?
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full h-px bg-brand-text/10 mb-16"></div>

      {/* 6. MILESTONES */}
      <div class="mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto w-full">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-8 text-center">A Few Milestones</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-sm md:text-base">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-8">
            <div class="font-bold w-16 shrink-0 mb-1 md:mb-0">2026</div>
            <div>Built this personal digital archive.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-8">
            <div class="font-bold w-16 shrink-0 mb-1 md:mb-0">2025</div>
            <div>Began studying Informatics, learning how to take software apart.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-8">
            <div class="font-bold w-16 shrink-0 mb-1 md:mb-0">2023</div>
            <div>Started exploring UI/UX design.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full h-px bg-brand-text/10 mb-16"></div>

      {/* OUTRO */}
      <div class="text-center py-4">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brand-text/40 leading-relaxed italic">
          I don't have everything figured out.<br/>
          Still wondering.<br/>
          Still wandering.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
